			"widgets_values":[
				"\"Two animated characters sit side by side at a desk in a bright, warm-lit studio setup. On the left is a dog with a professional demeanor wearing a blue uniform, and on the right is a curious orange cat with a blue collar and bell.  \n\nThe video atmosphere is cozy and professional, resembling a podcast studio. The dog speaks first, his mouth naturally moving as he looks towards the cat. The cat listens attentively, nodding slightly before responding with animated enthusiasm. Both characters exhibit subtle movements like blinking and slight shifts in posture to maintain realism.  \n\nThe camera starts with a medium shot, slowly zooming in to create an engaging conversation dynamic.  \n\nAudio is clean and professional, recorded in a quiet room. The dog speaks in a confident male voice, and the cat responds in a lively, slightly higher-pitched female voice.  \n\nDialogue:  \n主持人（男）：“最近大家都在聊AI 大模型，你用了吗？”  \n嘉宾（女）：“用了！说实话，第一次让它帮我写文案，我真的有点慌。”  \n主持人（男）：“哈哈，为什么慌？”  \n嘉宾（女）：“因为它写得又快又好，感觉自己的饭碗都要被抢了一样。”\""
